", "id": 5, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "I mean, there are all these players.", "type": "text"}], "correct": 0}, {"text": "", "id": 6, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "They just stood out there, on the field.", "type": "text"}], "correct": true}, {"text": "", "id": 7, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "People just talked and watched.", "type": "text"}], "correct": true}, {"text": "", "id": 8, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "Suddenly, when a player hit the ball out of the park, ", "type": "text"}], "correct": true}, {"text": "", "id": 9, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "everyone went crazy.", "type": "text"}], "correct": true}, {"text": "", "id": 10, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "I didn't enjoy it at all!", "type": "text"}], "correct": true}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Jayne is remembering her first baseball game.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Read the text and select all the sentences that are about a past experience.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}]}], "type": "SLS", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 10, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "type": "RSLT", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 11, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn8le08ob06re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nBe a Sportswriter for a Day\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn8le08ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tI hope we'll make it in time for the start of the game. I managed to get some pretty good seats. I had bought cheaper tickets at first, before you told me you liked sports. So, I thought you could enjoy our national pastime up close!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Rosa</span>:\t\tI'm excited, even though I know very little about baseball. I had read up on it before I moved to Boston, but I didn't go very far in my research.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tThat's fine. I'm sure you must be familiar with home runs and innings.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Rosa</span>:\t\tNot quite ... what's an inning?", "id": 1, "time": "100 ", "image": "engenn8le08ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tIt's like a half-time in soccer. Each team bats, then defends.  Games usually last up to 9 innings.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Rosa</span>:\t\tThat must last longer than a game of soccer!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tIt often does. Some games may be delayed or postponed because of that. I remember one time, people had left right before our best player hit it out of the park.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Rosa</span>:\t\tOh, I've heard that expression before!", "id": 2, "time": "31000", "image": "engenn8le08ob06re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tFor sure. We use many baseball metaphors in English.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Rosa</span>:\t\tBefore I came to the States, I had only heard about how popular baseball was in Boston. Now I understand.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tOf course! You must have heard we all support the Red Sox here!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Rosa</span>:\t\tWell, baseball is still incomprehensible to me, but I might make an effort for you.", "id": 3, "time": "54800", "image": "engenn8le08ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tBetter late than never. You couldn't possibly regret it!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Rosa</span>:\t\tShall we order dessert?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tSorry, Rosa, but we are really late now. We'll have to take a rain check on that dessert.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Rosa</span>:\t\tAnother baseball expression?", "id": 4, "time": "76000", "image": "engenn8le08ob06re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le08ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le08ob06re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}